SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This MIT licence covers the SOFTWARE in this repository: the ingestion, quality
control, split-construction, modelling, evaluation and manuscript-build code.

DATA are licensed separately:

* The frozen benchmark definition (`benchmark/splits/`) — split definitions,
  station table, temporal blocks and checksums — is released under
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).

* Derived result tables (`paper/tables/`) are released under CC BY 4.0.

* The underlying PM2.5 OBSERVATIONS are NOT redistributed by this repository
  and are NOT covered by either licence. They originate with the OpenAQ
  platform and its contributing providers (US Department of State AirNow and
  StateAir programmes; Clarity), whose per-provider terms differ and have not
  been transcribed for every contributor. `data/MANIFEST.md` records the
  provenance of each source and the commands that rebuild the derived panel
  from the original archive under those providers' own terms.

This separation is deliberate: releasing observations under a licence we have
not verified would assert redistribution rights we do not hold.
